(module aslHarness/autonomousPipelineTest :x [testStageTemperatureConfigDefaults testStageTemperatureResolution testAllFivePipelineProfiles testPipelineProfileLookup testAutonomousSelectionCreative testAutonomousSelectionSecurity testAutonomousSelectionTrivial testAutonomousSelectionArchitecture testAutonomousSelectionStandard testHarnessModelStandImplementationCalibration testHarnessModelStandReflectionCalibration testHarnessModelStandPlanningCalibration testHarnessModelStandFullSweep testAsnSerialization runTests] :i [(autonomousPipeline :a ap)])

fn testStageTemperatureConfigDefaults -> Bool
  (let [(cfg (ap/defaultStageTemperatures))] (do (assert (= cfg.planningTemp 0.70) "Default planning temperature must be 0.70") (assert (= cfg.reflectionTemp 0.20) "Default reflection temperature must be 0.20") (assert (= cfg.implementationTemp 0.00) "Default implementation temperature must be strictly 0.00") (assert (= cfg.verificationTemp 0.00) "Default verification temperature must be strictly 0.00") (assert (= cfg.scoutTemp 0.10) "Default scout temperature must be 0.10") true))

fn testStageTemperatureResolution -> Bool
  (let [(cfg (ap/defaultStageTemperatures))] (do (assert (= (ap/stageTemperatureFor cfg "plan") 0.70) "Plan stage temperature must match") (assert (= (ap/stageTemperatureFor cfg "planning") 0.70) "Planning alias temperature must match") (assert (= (ap/stageTemperatureFor cfg "decomposition") 0.70) "Decomposition alias must match") (assert (= (ap/stageTemperatureFor cfg "reflect") 0.20) "Reflect stage temperature must match") (assert (= (ap/stageTemperatureFor cfg "gap-audit") 0.20) "Gap audit alias must match") (assert (= (ap/stageTemperatureFor cfg "review") 0.20) "Review alias must match") (assert (= (ap/stageTemperatureFor cfg "impl") 0.00) "Impl stage temperature must match 0.00") (assert (= (ap/stageTemperatureFor cfg "codegen") 0.00) "Codegen alias must match 0.00") (assert (= (ap/stageTemperatureFor cfg "verify") 0.00) "Verify stage temperature must match 0.00") (assert (= (ap/stageTemperatureFor cfg "gate-check") 0.00) "Gate check alias must match 0.00") (assert (= (ap/stageTemperatureFor cfg "scout") 0.10) "Scout stage temperature must match 0.10") (assert (= (ap/stageTemperatureFor cfg "unknown-stage") 0.00) "Unknown stage defaults to 0.00") true))

fn testAllFivePipelineProfiles -> Bool
  (let [(profs (ap/availablePipelineProfiles)) (fast (ap/makeFastPipeline)) (std (ap/makeStandardPipeline)) (deep (ap/makeDeepEpistemicPipeline)) (crt (ap/makeCreativeSynthesisPipeline)) (sec (ap/makeAdversarialHardeningPipeline))] (do (assert (= (listLength profs) 5) "Must have exactly 5 autonomous pipeline profiles") (assert (= fast.id "fast") "Fast pipeline ID must match") (assert fast.supportsFastPath "Fast pipeline must support fast-path") (assert (= (listLength fast.stages) 2) "Fast pipeline must have 2 stages") (assert (= std.id "standard") "Standard pipeline ID must match") (assert (= (listLength std.stages) 5) "Standard pipeline must have 5 stages") (assert (= deep.id "deep-epistemic") "Deep epistemic pipeline ID must match") (assert (= (listLength deep.stages) 7) "Deep epistemic pipeline must have 7 stages") (assert (= crt.id "creative-synthesis") "Creative pipeline ID must match") (assert (= crt.tempConfig.planningTemp 0.75) "Creative planning temp must be 0.75") (assert (= crt.tempConfig.reflectionTemp 0.30) "Creative reflection temp must be 0.30") (assert (= sec.id "adversarial-hardening") "Security pipeline ID must match") (assert (= sec.tempConfig.planningTemp 0.40) "Security planning temp must be 0.40") (assert (= sec.tempConfig.reflectionTemp 0.10) "Security reflection temp must be 0.10") (assert (= sec.tempConfig.implementationTemp 0.00) "Security impl temp must be 0.00") true))

fn testPipelineProfileLookup -> Bool
  (let [(profs (ap/availablePipelineProfiles)) (foundFast (ap/findPipelineProfile profs "fast")) (foundSec (ap/findPipelineProfile profs "adversarial-hardening")) (foundNone (ap/findPipelineProfile profs "non-existent"))] (do (assert (not (none? foundFast)) "Should find fast pipeline") (assert (not (none? foundSec)) "Should find security pipeline") (assert (none? foundNone) "Non-existent profile must be None") true))

fn testAutonomousSelectionCreative -> Bool
  (let [(prompt "Generate scalable vector graphics SVG mascot and interactive 2D canvas game loop with neon palette") (dec (ap/autonomousSelectPipeline "TASK-CRT-01" prompt "" 3 0.1 0.3))] (do (assert (= dec.detectedDomain "creative") "Domain must be detected as creative") (assert (= dec.selectedProfile.id "creative-synthesis") "Selected pipeline must be creative-synthesis") (assert (>= dec.confidence 0.90) "Confidence must be at least 0.90") (assert (= dec.selectedProfile.tempConfig.planningTemp 0.75) "Planning temp must be 0.75") (assert (= dec.selectedProfile.tempConfig.implementationTemp 0.00) "Implementation temp must be 0.00") true))

fn testAutonomousSelectionSecurity -> Bool
  (let [(prompt "Patch critical XSS vulnerability and sanitize input in cryptographic auth session tokens") (dec (ap/autonomousSelectPipeline "TASK-SEC-01" prompt "" 4 0.95 0.2))] (do (assert (= dec.detectedDomain "security") "Domain must be detected as security") (assert (= dec.selectedProfile.id "adversarial-hardening") "Selected pipeline must be adversarial-hardening") (assert (>= dec.confidence 0.95) "Confidence must be at least 0.95") (assert (= dec.selectedProfile.tempConfig.planningTemp 0.40) "Defensive planning temp must be 0.40") (assert (= dec.selectedProfile.tempConfig.reflectionTemp 0.10) "Adversarial reflection temp must be 0.10") (assert (= dec.selectedProfile.tempConfig.implementationTemp 0.00) "Strict zero-temp impl must hold") true))

fn testAutonomousSelectionTrivial -> Bool
  (let [(prompt "Fix minor typo in docstring of helper module") (dec (ap/autonomousSelectPipeline "TASK-TRIV-01" prompt "" 1 0.0 0.0))] (do (assert (= dec.detectedDomain "trivial") "Domain must be detected as trivial") (assert (= dec.selectedProfile.id "fast") "Selected pipeline must be fast") (assert dec.selectedProfile.supportsFastPath "Fast-path must be enabled") (assert (< dec.computedEntropy 1.5) "Entropy must be below 1.5 threshold") true))

fn testAutonomousSelectionArchitecture -> Bool
  (let [(prompt "Perform deep architectural refactoring of distributed state machine across all monorepo packages") (dec (ap/autonomousSelectPipeline "TASK-ARCH-01" prompt "" 10 0.2 0.8))] (do (assert (= dec.detectedDomain "architecture") "Domain must be detected as architecture") (assert (= dec.selectedProfile.id "deep-epistemic") "Selected pipeline must be deep-epistemic") (assert (>= dec.computedEntropy 4.0) "Entropy must be >= 4.0") (assert (= (listLength dec.selectedProfile.stages) 7) "Deep epistemic pipeline must have 7 stages") true))

fn testAutonomousSelectionStandard -> Bool
  (let [(prompt "Add pagination support and filter query parameters to user profile list endpoint") (dec (ap/autonomousSelectPipeline "TASK-STD-01" prompt "" 2 0.1 0.2))] (do (assert (= dec.detectedDomain "standard") "Domain must be standard") (assert (= dec.selectedProfile.id "standard") "Selected pipeline must be standard") (assert (and (>= dec.computedEntropy 1.5) (< dec.computedEntropy 4.0)) "Entropy in standard bounds") true))

fn testHarnessModelStandImplementationCalibration -> Bool
  (let [(ptZero (ap/evaluateStageTemperaturePoint "small" "impl" 0.00)) (ptLow (ap/evaluateStageTemperaturePoint "small" "impl" 0.10)) (ptMid (ap/evaluateStageTemperaturePoint "small" "impl" 0.30))] (do (assert ptZero.isParetoOptimal "T=0.00 must be strictly Pareto-optimal for implementation") (assert (= ptZero.syntaxIntegrity 100.0) "T=0.00 must yield 100% syntax integrity") (assert (= ptZero.hallucinationRate 0.0) "T=0.00 must yield 0% hallucination rate") (assert (> ptZero.paretoScore ptLow.paretoScore) "T=0.00 Pareto score must exceed T=0.10") (assert (> ptLow.paretoScore ptMid.paretoScore) "T=0.10 Pareto score must exceed T=0.30") (assert (not ptLow.isParetoOptimal) "T=0.10 is sub-optimal for implementation due to syntax drift") true))

fn testHarnessModelStandReflectionCalibration -> Bool
  (let [(ptZero (ap/evaluateStageTemperaturePoint "small" "reflect" 0.00)) (ptOpt (ap/evaluateStageTemperaturePoint "small" "reflect" 0.20)) (ptHigh (ap/evaluateStageTemperaturePoint "small" "reflect" 0.50))] (do (assert ptOpt.isParetoOptimal "T=0.20 must be Pareto-optimal for reflection") (assert (> ptOpt.coverageScore ptZero.coverageScore) "T=0.20 catches more edge cases than T=0.00") (assert (< ptOpt.hallucinationRate 3.0) "T=0.20 maintains very low hallucination rate") (assert (> ptOpt.paretoScore ptHigh.paretoScore) "T=0.20 Pareto score must exceed T=0.50") (assert (not ptHigh.isParetoOptimal) "T=0.50 triggers false positive hallucinated rejections") true))

fn testHarnessModelStandPlanningCalibration -> Bool
  (let [(ptLow (ap/evaluateStageTemperaturePoint "small" "plan" 0.10)) (ptOpt (ap/evaluateStageTemperaturePoint "small" "plan" 0.70)) (ptHigh (ap/evaluateStageTemperaturePoint "small" "plan" 0.90))] (do (assert ptOpt.isParetoOptimal "T=0.70 must be Pareto-optimal for planning on small tier") (assert (> ptOpt.coverageScore ptLow.coverageScore) "T=0.70 generates deeper multi-hypothesis plan") (assert (< ptOpt.hallucinationRate 4.0) "T=0.70 maintains bounded hallucination rate under 4%") (assert (> ptOpt.paretoScore ptHigh.paretoScore) "T=0.70 Pareto score must exceed T=0.90") (assert (not ptHigh.isParetoOptimal) "T=0.90 suffers ungrounded symbol hallucination penalties") true))

fn testHarnessModelStandFullSweep -> Bool
  (let [(sweepSmall (ap/runHarnessStageCalibration "small")) (sweepMicro (ap/runHarnessStageCalibration "micro"))] (do (assert (= sweepSmall.modelAlias "small") "Small model alias matches") (assert (= sweepSmall.memoryLimitMb 2150) "Small model memory ceiling is 2150MB") (assert (= (listLength sweepSmall.stagePoints) 12) "Must have 12 tested calibration points") (assert (= sweepSmall.optimalTemps.planningTemp 0.70) "Small optimal planning temp is 0.70") (assert (= sweepSmall.optimalTemps.reflectionTemp 0.20) "Small optimal reflection temp is 0.20") (assert (= sweepSmall.optimalTemps.implementationTemp 0.00) "Small optimal impl temp is strictly 0.00") (assert (= sweepMicro.modelAlias "micro") "Micro model alias matches") (assert (= sweepMicro.memoryLimitMb 480) "Micro model memory ceiling is 480MB") (assert (= sweepMicro.optimalTemps.planningTemp 0.50) "Micro optimal planning temp is conservative 0.50") (assert (= sweepMicro.optimalTemps.reflectionTemp 0.10) "Micro optimal reflection temp is conservative 0.10") (assert (= sweepMicro.optimalTemps.implementationTemp 0.00) "Micro optimal impl temp is strictly 0.00") true))

fn testAsnSerialization -> Bool
  (let [(temps (ap/defaultStageTemperatures)) (prof (ap/makeDeepEpistemicPipeline)) (dec (ap/autonomousSelectPipeline "T-01" "Build SVG game" "" 2 0.0 0.0)) (sweep (ap/runHarnessStageCalibration "small")) (sTemps (ap/formatStageTemperatureAsn temps)) (sProf (ap/formatPipelineProfileAsn prof)) (sDec (ap/formatSelectionDecisionAsn dec)) (sSweep (ap/formatHarnessStandSweepAsn sweep))] (do (assert (stringContains? sTemps ":planning") "Stage temp ASN contains planning") (assert (stringContains? sTemps ":implementation") "Stage temp ASN contains implementation") (assert (stringContains? sProf "deep-epistemic") "Profile ASN contains pipeline ID") (assert (stringContains? sDec ":selected-pipeline") "Decision ASN contains selected pipeline") (assert (stringContains? sSweep "small") "Sweep ASN contains model alias") true))

fn runTests -> Bool
  (do (assert (testStageTemperatureConfigDefaults)) (assert (testStageTemperatureResolution)) (assert (testAllFivePipelineProfiles)) (assert (testPipelineProfileLookup)) (assert (testAutonomousSelectionCreative)) (assert (testAutonomousSelectionSecurity)) (assert (testAutonomousSelectionTrivial)) (assert (testAutonomousSelectionArchitecture)) (assert (testAutonomousSelectionStandard)) (assert (testHarnessModelStandImplementationCalibration)) (assert (testHarnessModelStandReflectionCalibration)) (assert (testHarnessModelStandPlanningCalibration)) (assert (testHarnessModelStandFullSweep)) (assert (testAsnSerialization)) true)
